{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X的纵向交替排法和较多感受词会增加扫读负担，尤其在S03、S06、S13，Y的左右分栏更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然不如Y的左右分栏直观，但【】高亮让人能迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，而感受词按音乐出现的时机呈现，也更容易把听到的旋律和人物当下的情绪对应起来。更重要的是，X把愤怒、怀念、孤独、对亲近的渴望、对回去的犹疑，直到带着想念继续生活的变化交代得更细，人物为什么这样想、前后情绪如何转变都更容易理解。Y的叙事也清楚，但不少音乐感受被压缩成概括性短语，具体的情绪转折和音乐细节不如X鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a6dc713c-bbf3-49c2-be4a-79b3d3ec0abd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232137703481Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.032, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:22:16.752201+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "68c5a7c5ae330cd81d89fa4b83486fc6ecb21ffbf6de0474f9cbf69e87ea03a6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha